                                 </fo:basic-link> - indicates that the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">Meter</fo:inline>
            measures the power consumption.</fo:block>
