                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> data structure to provide
      metering information.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Meter</fo:inline> function service can be optionally registered
      with <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.functions.Meter.SERVICE_FLOW">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">SERVICE_FLOW</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> service property. The value type is
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String</fo:inline>. It contains the metering flow. Currently,
      the flow can be <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.functions.Meter.FLOW_IN">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">FLOW_IN</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> for a consumption or <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.functions.Meter.FLOW_OUT">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">FLOW_OUT</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> for a production.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="service.dal.functions-alarm">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>142.2.6</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Alarm</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.functions.Alarm">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Alarm</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> function provides alarm sensor support. There is
      only one eventable property and no operations. The property eventing
      must follow the definition of Device Abstraction Layer, <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">???</fo:inline>. The full function definition is
      available in the next table.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions"
                         space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="auto"
                         id="d615e719">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Table 142.7</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>BooleanSensor Properties</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                            border-collapse="collapse"
                            table-layout="fixed"
                            width="100%">
                     <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                     <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                     <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                      keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                      font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Name</fo:block>
