                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">alarm</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Specifies the alarm property name. The property is
              eventable.</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-body>
                  </fo:table>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The function is using <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.dal.functions-data.alarm">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">AlarmData</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal.functions-data.alarm"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> data structure to report
      the alarm. The property eventing must follow the definition of Device
      Abstraction Layer, <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">???</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="service.dal.functions-keypad">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>142.2.7</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Keypad</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.functions.Keypad">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Keypad</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> function provides support for keypad control.
      The keypad typically consists of one or more keys/buttons, which can be
      discerned. Different types of key presses like short and long press can
      typically also be detected. Each key pressed event is followed by a key
      released event. It's not possible to have two consecutive key pressed or
      key released events. There is only one eventable property and no
      operations. The property eventing must follow the definition of Device
      Abstraction Layer, <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">???</fo:inline>. The
      full function definition is available in the next table.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions"
                         space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="auto"
                         id="d615e744">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Table 142.8</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>Keypad Properties</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                            border-collapse="collapse"
                            table-layout="fixed"
                            width="100%">
                     <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                     <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                     <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                      keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                      font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Name</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Description</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-header>
                     <fo:table-body start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">key</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Specifies a property name for a key from the keypad. The
              property is eventable.</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-body>
                  </fo:table>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The function is using <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.dal.functions-data.keypad">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">KeypadData</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal.functions-data.keypad"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> data structure to report
      the keys.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="service.dal.functions-wake.up">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>142.2.8</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>WakeUp</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.functions.WakeUp">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">WakeUp</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> function provides device awake monitoring. It's
      especially applicable to battery-operated devices. Such device can
      notify the system that it's awake and can receive commands with a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.functions.WakeUp.PROPERTY_AWAKE">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">PROPERTY_AWAKE</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> property event. The property eventing must
      follow the definition of Device Abstraction Layer, <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">???</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The device can periodically wake up for commands. The interval can
      be managed with <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.functions.WakeUp.PROPERTY_WAKE_UP_INTERVAL">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">PROPERTY_WAKE_UP_INTERVAL</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> property.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions"
                         space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="auto"
                         id="d615e773">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Table 142.9</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>WakeUp Properties</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                            border-collapse="collapse"
                            table-layout="fixed"
                            width="100%">
                     <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                     <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                     <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                      keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                      font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Name</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Description</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-header>
                     <fo:table-body start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">awake</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Specifies the awake eventable property name. If the
              device is awake, it will trigger a property event. The property
              value type is <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="service.dal.functions-data.boolean">
                                    <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                               font-family="inherit"
                                               letter-spacing="inherit"
                                               hyphenate="inherit">
                                       <fo:inline font-style="italic">BooleanData</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal.functions-data.boolean"/>
                                    </fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">wakeUpInterval</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Specifies the wake up interval. The device can
              periodically wake up and receive commands. That interval is
              managed by this property. The property access is readable,
              writable and eventable. The property value type is <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="service.dal.functions-data.level">
                                    <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                               font-family="inherit"
                                               letter-spacing="inherit"
                                               hyphenate="inherit">
                                       <fo:inline font-style="italic">LevelData</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal.functions-data.level"/>
                                    </fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-body>
                  </fo:table>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="service.dal.functions-data">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Functions Data</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>142.3</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Functions Data</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
               <fo:inline color="blue"
                          font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em"
                          hyphenate="false">???</fo:inline> subclasses are wrappers on top of the java types
    to cover the requirements of the Device Abstraction Layer section. They
    can be received with the getter methods, can be set with the setter
    methods and can be reported with <fo:inline color="blue"
                          font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em"
                          hyphenate="false">???</fo:inline>. The
    value can be described with different properties like: <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d615e802">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d615e803">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>timestamp - the timestamp is the difference between the value
          collecting time and midnight, January 1, 1970 UTC. It's measured in
          milliseconds. The device driver is responsible to generate that
          value when the value is received from the device.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d615e805">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>unit - represents the value unit as it's defined in <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                         font-family="inherit"
                                         letter-spacing="inherit"
                                         hyphenate="inherit">???</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d615e810">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>description - represents a human readable description of the
          value.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="service.dal.functions-data.boolean">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>142.3.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>BooleanData</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.functions.data.BooleanData">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">BooleanData</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> is used by <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.dal.functions-boolean.control">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">BooleanControl</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal.functions-boolean.control"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>, <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.dal.functions-boolean.sensor">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">BooleanSensor</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal.functions-boolean.sensor"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> and <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.dal.functions-wake.up">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">WakeUp</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal.functions-wake.up"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">It provides information about the function state. That data object
      contains boolean value, the value collecting time and additional
      metadata. The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">value</fo:inline> field is accessible with <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.functions.data.BooleanData.getValue--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">getValue()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> getter. Other fields are inherited from the
      parent class <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">???</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Two <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">BooleanData</fo:inline> instances are equal if they contain
      equal metadata, timestamp and boolean value.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.functions.data.BooleanData.compareTo-Object-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">compareTo(Object)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method compares <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">BooleanData</fo:inline>
      instance with the given argument of the same type and returns:
      <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d615e840">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d615e841">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">-1</fo:inline> if the instance field is less than a field
            of the specified argument.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d615e845">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">0</fo:inline> if all fields are equivalent.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d615e849">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">1</fo:inline> if the instance field is greater than a field
            of the specified argument.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block> The fields are compared in this order: timestamp,
      metadata, value.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="service.dal.functions-data.level">
               <fo:block>
