 {@code BooleanSensor} - indicates that the {@code BooleanSensor} supports
 gas detection. {@code true} state means there is gas. {@code false} state
 means that there is no gas.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
