               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dal.functions.Types.POWER">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>142.4.9.14</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final String POWER = "power"</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
The function type is applicable to:
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d615e1862">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d615e1863">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
 {@code MultiLevelControl} - indicates that the {@code MultiLevelControl}
 can control the power level. {@code MultiLevelControl} minimum value is
 the lowest supported power level. {@code MultiLevelControl} maximum value
 is the highest supported power level.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d615e1865">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
 {@code MultiLevelSensor} - indicates that the sensor can monitor the
 power level.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d615e1867">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
 {@code BooleanSensor} - indicates that the {@code BooleanSensor} can
 detect power/no power. {@code true} state means that there is power.
 {@code false} state means that there is no power.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d615e1869">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
 {@code BooleanControl} - indicates that there is electricity control.
 {@code true} state means that the power will be restored. {@code false}
 state means that the power will be cut.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d615e1871">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
 {@code Meter} - indicates that the {@code Meter} measures the power
 consumption.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 This type can be specified as a value of
 {@link org.osgi.service.dal.Function#SERVICE_TYPE}.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
